  "title": "Retractable Technologies, Inc. Results for the Period Ended March 31, 2026",
  "summary": "LITTLE ELM, Texas – Retractable Technologies, Inc. (NYSE American: RVP) reports total net sales of $7.2 million for the first three months of 2026 and an operating loss of $6.2 million for the period, as compared to total net sales for the same period last year of $8.3 million and an operating loss of $4.7 […]",
